Dialogue: 0,1:36:28.17,1:36:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,再搞一次吧
Dialogue: 0,1:40:20.80,1:40:23.13,Default,,0,0,0,,去了
Dialogue: 0,1:41:02.14,1:41:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,可以嗎
